        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Kandih ram khou hei kanloumeipu,",
            "Alung rianra na bam pu the;",
            "Jailou naro nang ram khou 8#@,",
            "Poubaumei Jisu.",
            "",
            "Chorus:",
            "Theimei, kapmei, kalangmei dui,",
            "Pang khourui jai kanpat lou o;",
            "Njianmei ntam mei guai le,",
            "Neilana bam cham khang.",
            "",
            "2. Jangsimei le mikdui kei mei hei,",
            "Rianra khanga kap pui ram;",
            "Munpuang kum sini kandih hei,",
            "Rianra kap pui ram.",
            "",
            "3. He! njianmei poubaumei hukhou,",
            "Sa pulak khe ntampui lat;",
            "Laujiu Nah rui khang lou khou rui,",
            "Neilana suanni.",
            "",
            "4. Ganphiu kum e poubaumei Jisu,",
            "Pap rui alung jing bam pukhou;",
            "Nang chang nchummei 8#@ hou khang,",
            "Akhou tigan no."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
